WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.667
The three main choices in this module differ in lifetime and storage.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:07.467
A CTE exists for one statement.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:15.037
A standard view is a persistent database object, but it stores the query definition rather than a result

00:00:15.037 --> 00:00:19.777
snapshot. A materialized view is persistent and stores the query result.

00:00:19.777 --> 00:00:25.182
Choose among them based on reuse, freshness, and computational cost.

00:00:25.182 --> 00:00:31.682
Connect this idea to an analytics team exposing a stable reporting view to dashboard users.

00:00:31.682 --> 00:00:37.602
Ask what could go wrong if the concept were misunderstood: could rows be duplicated,

00:00:37.602 --> 00:00:45.127
important records disappear, categories be interpreted incorrectly, or a report become difficult to reproduce?

00:00:45.127 --> 00:00:51.027
A strong analyst can explain both the SQL operation and the assumption behind it.

00:00:51.027 --> 00:00:56.844
After the example, summarize the idea in one plain-language sentence before moving on.
